# The smoke replay: open the shell, read the help, quit. CI runs this against
# config.local.toml, which names two connections and connects to neither, so
# no database has to be up.

expect 1 local-mssql ○  2 local-oracle ○
frame shell

key ?
expect ╭ Help · Objects ─
expect Ctrl-T     next tab
frame help
key Esc
expect-not ╭ Help

key Tab
expect ╭ Scratch
key Shift-Tab

key q
